#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "mq_open"
msgstr "mq_open"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "2024-05-02"
msgstr "2 mai 2024"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux man-pages 6.9.1"
msgstr "Pagini de manual de Linux 6.9.1"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NUME"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "mq_open - open a message queue"
msgstr "mq_open - deschide o coadă de mesaje"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "LIBRARY"
msgstr "BIBLIOTECA"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Real-time library (I<librt>, I<-lrt>)"
msgstr "Biblioteca de timp real (I<librt>, I<-lrt>)"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SINOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<#include E<lt>fcntl.hE<gt>>           /* For O_* constants */\n"
"B<#include E<lt>sys/stat.hE<gt>>        /* For mode constants */\n"
"B<#include E<lt>mqueue.hE<gt>>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<#include E<lt>fcntl.hE<gt>>           /* Pentru constantele O_* */\n"
"B<#include E<lt>sys/stat.hE<gt>>        /* Pentru constantele de mod */\n"
"B<#include E<lt>mqueue.hE<gt>>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<mqd_t mq_open(const char *>I<name>B<, int >I<oflag>B<);>\n"
"B<mqd_t mq_open(const char *>I<name>B<, int >I<oflag>B<, mode_t >I<mode>B<,>\n"
"B<              struct mq_attr *>I<attr>B<);>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<mqd_t mq_open(const char *>I<nume>B<, int >I<oflag>B<);>\n"
"B<mqd_t mq_open(const char *>I<nume>B<, int >I<oflag>B<, mode_t >I<mode>B<,>\n"
"B<              struct mq_attr *>I<attr>B<);>\n"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIERE"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<mq_open>()  creates a new POSIX message queue or opens an existing queue.  "
"The queue is identified by I<name>.  For details of the construction of "
"I<name>, see B<mq_overview>(7)."
msgstr ""
"B<mq_open>() creează o nouă coadă de mesaje POSIX sau deschide o coadă "
"existentă. Coada este identificată prin I<nume>. Pentru detalii despre "
"construcția lui I<nume>, consultați B<mq_overview>(7)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The I<oflag> argument specifies flags that control the operation of the "
"call.  (Definitions of the flags values can be obtained by including "
"I<E<lt>fcntl.hE<gt>>.)  Exactly one of the following must be specified in "
"I<oflag>:"
msgstr ""
"Argumentul I<oflag> specifică fanioanele care controlează funcționarea "
"apelului; (definițiile valorilor fanioanelor pot fi obținute prin includerea "
"I<E<lt>fcntl.hE<gt>>). În I<oflag> trebuie specificat exact unul dintre "
"următoarele:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<O_RDONLY>"
msgstr "B<O_RDONLY>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Open the queue to receive messages only."
msgstr "Deschide coada numai pentru a primi mesaje."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<O_WRONLY>"
msgstr "B<O_WRONLY>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Open the queue to send messages only."
msgstr "Deschide coada numai pentru a trimite mesaje."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<O_RDWR>"
msgstr "B<O_RDWR>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Open the queue to both send and receive messages."
msgstr "Deschide coada pentru a trimite și a primi mesaje."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Zero or more of the following flags can additionally be I<OR>ed in I<oflag>:"
msgstr ""
"Zero sau mai multe dintre următoarele fanioane pot fi adăugate cu operatorul "
"I<OR> în I<oflag>:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<O_CLOEXEC> (since Linux 2.6.26)"
msgstr "B<O_CLOEXEC> (începând cu Linux 2.6.26)"

#.  commit 269f21344b23e552c21c9e2d7ca258479dcd7a0a
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Set the close-on-exec flag for the message queue descriptor.  See "
"B<open>(2)  for a discussion of why this flag is useful."
msgstr ""
"Activează fanionul close-on-exec pentru descriptorul cozii de mesaje.  "
"Consultați B<open>(2) pentru a afla de ce este util acest fanion."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<O_CREAT>"
msgstr "B<O_CREAT>"

#.  In reality the filesystem IDs are used on Linux.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Create the message queue if it does not exist.  The owner (user ID) of the "
"message queue is set to the effective user ID of the calling process.  The "
"group ownership (group ID) is set to the effective group ID of the calling "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Creează coada de mesaje dacă aceasta nu există. Proprietarul (ID utilizator) "
"cozii de mesaje este stabilit la ID-ul utilizatorului efectiv al procesului "
"apelant. Grupul proprietar (ID de grup) este stabilit la ID-ul de grup "
"efectiv al procesului apelant."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<O_EXCL>"
msgstr "B<O_EXCL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If B<O_CREAT> was specified in I<oflag>, and a queue with the given I<name> "
"already exists, then fail with the error B<EEXIST>."
msgstr ""
"Dacă B<O_CREAT> a fost specificat în I<oflag>, iar o coadă cu numele I<nume> "
"dat există deja, atunci eșuează cu eroarea B<EEXIST>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<O_NONBLOCK>"
msgstr "B<O_NONBLOCK>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Open the queue in nonblocking mode.  In circumstances where "
"B<mq_receive>(3)  and B<mq_send>(3)  would normally block, these functions "
"instead fail with the error B<EAGAIN>."
msgstr ""
"Deschide coada în modul neblocant. În situațiile în care B<mq_receive>(3) și "
"B<mq_send>(3) s-ar bloca în mod normal, aceste funcții eșuează cu eroarea "
"B<EAGAIN>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If B<O_CREAT> is specified in I<oflag>, then two additional arguments must "
"be supplied.  The I<mode> argument specifies the permissions to be placed on "
"the new queue, as for B<open>(2).  (Symbolic definitions for the permissions "
"bits can be obtained by including I<E<lt>sys/stat.hE<gt>>.)  The permissions "
"settings are masked against the process umask."
msgstr ""
"Dacă B<O_CREAT> este specificat în I<oflag>, atunci trebuie furnizate două "
"argumente suplimentare. Argumentul I<mode> specifică permisiunile care "
"urmează să fie plasate pe noua coadă, ca pentru B<open>(2); (definițiile "
"simbolice pentru biții de permisiuni pot fi obținute prin includerea "
"I<E<lt>sys/stat.hE<gt>>). Definițiile permisiunilor sunt mascate față de "
"umask-ul procesului."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The fields of the I<struct mq_attr> pointed to I<attr> specify the maximum "
"number of messages and the maximum size of messages that the queue will "
"allow.  This structure is defined as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Câmpurile din I<struct mq_attr> indicată de I<attr> specifică numărul maxim "
"de mesaje și dimensiunea maximă a mesajelor pe care coada le va permite. "
"Această structură este definită după cum urmează:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"struct mq_attr {\n"
"    long mq_flags;       /* Flags (ignored for mq_open()) */\n"
"    long mq_maxmsg;      /* Max. # of messages on queue */\n"
"    long mq_msgsize;     /* Max. message size (bytes) */\n"
"    long mq_curmsgs;     /* # of messages currently in queue\n"
"                            (ignored for mq_open()) */\n"
"};\n"
msgstr ""
"struct mq_attr {\n"
"    long mq_flags;       /* Fanioane (ignorate pentru mq_open()) */\n"
"    long mq_maxmsg;      /* Nr. maxim de mesaje în coadă */\n"
"    long mq_msgsize;     /* Dimensiunea maximă a mesajului (octeți) */\n"
"    long mq_curmsgs;     /* Nr. de mesaje aflate în prezent în coadă\n"
"                            (ignorat pentru mq_open()) */\n"
"};\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Only the I<mq_maxmsg> and I<mq_msgsize> fields are employed when calling "
"B<mq_open>(); the values in the remaining fields are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Numai câmpurile I<mq_maxmsg> și I<mq_msgsize> sunt utilizate atunci când se "
"apelează B<mq_open>(); valorile din celelalte câmpuri sunt ignorate."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If I<attr> is NULL, then the queue is created with implementation-defined "
"default attributes.  Since Linux 3.5, two I</proc> files can be used to "
"control these defaults; see B<mq_overview>(7)  for details."
msgstr ""
"Dacă I<attr> este NULL, atunci coada este creată cu atribute implicite "
"definite de implementare. Începând cu Linux 3.5, pot fi utilizate două "
"fișiere I</proc> pentru a controla aceste valori implicite; consultați "
"B<mq_overview>(7) pentru detalii."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOAREA RETURNATĂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"On success, B<mq_open>()  returns a message queue descriptor for use by "
"other message queue functions.  On error, B<mq_open>()  returns I<(mqd_t)\\ "
"-1>, with I<errno> set to indicate the error."
msgstr ""
"În caz de succes, B<mq_open>() returnează un descriptor al cozii de mesaje "
"pentru a fi utilizat de alte funcții ale cozii de mesaje. În caz de eroare, "
"B<mq_open>() returnează I<(mqd_t)\\ -1>, cu I<errno> configurată pentru a "
"indica eroarea."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ERRORS"
msgstr "ERORI-IEȘIRE"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EACCES>"
msgstr "B<EACCES>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The queue exists, but the caller does not have permission to open it in the "
"specified mode."
msgstr ""
"Coada există, dar apelantul nu are permisiunea de a o deschide în modul "
"specificat."

#.  Note that this isn't consistent with the same case for sem_open()
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "I<name> contained more than one slash."
msgstr "I<nume> conține mai mult de o bară oblică."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EEXIST>"
msgstr "B<EEXIST>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Both B<O_CREAT> and B<O_EXCL> were specified in I<oflag>, but a queue with "
"this I<name> already exists."
msgstr ""
"Atât B<O_CREAT> cât și B<O_EXCL> au fost specificate în I<oflag>, dar o "
"coadă cu acest I<nume> există deja."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EINVAL>"
msgstr "B<EINVAL>"

#.  glibc checks whether the name starts with a "/" and if not,
#.  gives this error
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "I<name> doesn't follow the format in B<mq_overview>(7)."
msgstr "I<nume> nu respectă formatul din B<mq_overview>(7)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<O_CREAT> was specified in I<oflag>, and I<attr> was not NULL, but I<attr-"
"E<gt>mq_maxmsg> or I<attr-E<gt>mq_msqsize> was invalid.  Both of these "
"fields must be greater than zero.  In a process that is unprivileged (does "
"not have the B<CAP_SYS_RESOURCE> capability), I<attr-E<gt>mq_maxmsg> must be "
"less than or equal to the I<msg_max> limit, and I<attr-E<gt>mq_msgsize> must "
"be less than or equal to the I<msgsize_max> limit.  In addition, even in a "
"privileged process, I<attr-E<gt>mq_maxmsg> cannot exceed the B<HARD_MAX> "
"limit.  (See B<mq_overview>(7)  for details of these limits.)"
msgstr ""
"B<O_CREAT> a fost specificat în I<oflag>, iar I<attr> nu era NULL, dar "
"I<attr-E<gt>mq_maxmsg> sau I<attr-E<gt>mq_msqsize> nu era valid. Ambele "
"câmpuri trebuie să fie mai mari decât zero. Într-un proces neprivilegiat "
"(care nu are capacitatea B<CAP_SYS_RESOURCE>), I<attr-E<gt>mq_maxmsg> "
"trebuie să fie mai mic sau egal cu limita I<msg_max>, iar I<attr-"
"E<gt>mq_msgsize> trebuie să fie mai mic sau egal cu limita I<msgsize_max>. "
"În plus, chiar și într-un proces privilegiat, I<attr-E<gt>mq_maxmsg> nu "
"poate depăși limita B<HARD_MAX>; (consultați B<mq_overview>(7) pentru "
"detalii despre aceste limite)."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EMFILE>"
msgstr "B<EMFILE>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The per-process limit on the number of open file and message queue "
"descriptors has been reached (see the description of B<RLIMIT_NOFILE> in "
"B<getrlimit>(2))."
msgstr ""
"A fost atinsă limita per-proces a numărului de descriptori de fișiere și de "
"cozi de mesaje deschise (a se vedea descrierea B<RLIMIT_NOFILE> în "
"B<getrlimit>(2))."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENAMETOOLONG>"
msgstr "B<ENAMETOOLONG>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "I<name> was too long."
msgstr "I<nume> era prea lung."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENFILE>"
msgstr "B<ENFILE>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The system-wide limit on the total number of open files and message queues "
"has been reached."
msgstr ""
"A fost atinsă limita la nivel de sistem privind numărul total de fișiere și "
"cozi de mesaje deschise."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENOENT>"
msgstr "B<ENOENT>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<O_CREAT> flag was not specified in I<oflag>, and no queue with this "
"I<name> exists."
msgstr ""
"Fanionul B<O_CREAT> nu a fost specificat în I<oflag> și nu există nicio "
"coadă cu acest I<nume>."

#.  Note that this isn't consistent with the same case for sem_open()
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "I<name> was just \"/\" followed by no other characters."
msgstr "I<nume> era doar „/” urmat de niciun alt caracter."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENOMEM>"
msgstr "B<ENOMEM>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Insufficient memory."
msgstr "Memorie insuficientă."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENOSPC>"
msgstr "B<ENOSPC>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Insufficient space for the creation of a new message queue.  This probably "
"occurred because the I<queues_max> limit was encountered; see "
"B<mq_overview>(7)."
msgstr ""
"Spațiu insuficient pentru crearea unei noi cozi de mesaje. Acest lucru s-a "
"întâmplat probabil pentru că s-a atins limita I<queues_max>; a se vedea "
"B<mq_overview>(7)."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
